{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_26","type":"agent_message","text":"Fixed the Intervals.icu connection flow. Connect now uses an authenticated POST, the requested scopes no longer duplicate areas, and the app no longer expires tokens after an invented hour. An API 401 clears the token and prompts reconnection.\n\nThe causes, which parts of the colleague’s note applied, and the verification limits are in [ANSWER.md](/tmp/h-Bkl5JI/ANSWER.md). Four local integration tests pass, and `static/app.js` passes `node --check`. A live Intervals test was not run because the workspace has placeholder credentials and external service use was excluded."}}
